<title>UK: Wolters Kluwer sets 500 mln guilder 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Wolters Kluwer sets 500 mln guilder 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WOLTERS KLUWER NV</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    11.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.43    PAY DATE    11.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.93     SPREAD	+55 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) **	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED FEB AND SEPT 2007 DSL</p>
<p>NOTES	**5-10 (K-FORM), 5-100-1M (CF-FORM)</p>
